WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Admin → Locations and choose Add location, or edit an existing row.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.708
Step 2: Set its name, state and available settings. Use Employer setup for this location’s legal employer, award coverage and pay period, then Save settings.

3
00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:20.708
Step 3: Use the archive action for an inactive location when permitted.

4
00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:26.708
Step 4: Open the separate Archived locations menu to find or restore archived stores.
